      "source": [
        "# 06 \u2014 Power BI Export\n",
        "\n",
        "**Week:** 8\n",
        "\n",
        "Goal: Export Gold outputs for Power BI Desktop.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Option 1: save Gold table as CSV files in a volume or accessible location.\n",
        "gold_df = spark.table(\"gold_event_summary_by_date\")\n",
        "\n",
        "export_path = \"/Volumes/workspace/default/<project_name>/gold_exports/gold_event_summary_by_date\"\n",
        "gold_df.coalesce(1).write.mode(\"overwrite\").option(\"header\", True).csv(export_path)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Gold export path:\", export_path)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Power BI Rule\n",
        "\n",
        "Power BI uses Gold-layer outputs only.\n"

"Data flow:\n"

"Raw Sources → Bronze → Silver → Data Quality → Gold → Power BI\n"

"Power BI is not connected directly to raw CSV files.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Evidence to Capture\n",
        "\n",
        "- Gold export verified in Databricks.\n"
"- Gold outputs connected to Power BI Desktop.\n"
"- Power BI dashboard created using Gold outputs.\n"
"- PBIX file saved in `dashboard/`.\n"
      ]
    }
